                token),
            $"Loop \"{draft.CollectionKey}\" created.");

    /// <summary>Deletes a loop marker; the cycle itself remains.</summary>
    /// <param name="loopId">The marker to delete.</param>
    private async Task DeleteLoopAsync(Guid loopId)
